OL,3,GNEWSANew mums 'left to get on with it'
OL,4,Aas C-section numbers hit record high
OL,5,
OL,6,FMothers have described being left to
OL,7,Frecover from caesarean sections with
OL,8,F"no support" as the number of babies
OL,9,Fbeing born via caesarean reaches its
OL,10,Fhighest rate on record.
OL,12,FA caesarean, or C-section, is a major
OL,13,Foperation to deliver a baby through a
OL,14,Fcut made in a woman's stomach and womb.
OL,16,FCarys Louise Brandon, from Swansea, had
OL,17,Fan emergency C-section to deliver her
OL,18,Ffirst child in 2022 and said she was
OL,19,Fcompletely unprepared for what came
OL,20,Fafterwards.
